# The option menus from the main menu, run after saveload.keys with
# dosrun -k so the saved games list has its save. A menu that returns on
# Return leaves the next to read the same key while it is down, so keys
# are short here. A menu keeps its selection. Areas are of the 1280x960
# screen dosrun's DOSBox draws in.

hold 0.05
wait menu 814x76+234+470 150
key Down Down Return
sleep 3
shot options
key Down Return
sleep 3
shot volume
key Return
sleep 3
shot back
key Down Return
sleep 3
shot saves
key Return
sleep 3
key Down Return
sleep 3
shot advanced
key Return
sleep 3
key Up Up Up Return
sleep 3
shot main
